WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,680
I accept the matter and accept it.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:05,590
If you want revenge, you don’t have to ask the Korean team to kill me.

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,350
Do you really think I dare not kill you?

4
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,510
You kill

5
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:12,250
Fanjian likes you

6
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:21,520
I don’t care if I, Jian Shan’an or Mr. Lin, Shan’an runs out.

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,600
Peaceful times

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,960
He helps me manage the company and we were supposed to get married. Someone downstairs said

9
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,080
They are evacuating tomorrow morning

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,320
Asking if you want to evacuate with them

11
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,040
Only one chance

12
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,760
Not evacuating with you

13
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:37,900
It will be almost impossible to escape from Bishi and pack your things in the future.

14
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,940
Bring the materials with you and evacuate with them tomorrow
